 # Local history: written incrementally, finalized at merge.
}

^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-10-12 19:07] decide — Creator asked to proceed with versioned parser releases on spw.quest: release first, variant and form as declared axes, the offset owned by the release, immutable dated paths, moving aliases, a manifest with revision, hashes and sizes, and CORS for /parser/. The workbench builds; spw.quest publishes.
 >>[2026-10-12 20:09] implement — Landed in 17b0d6d7: bundle:parser. spw.quest routes are built and tested in the site repo, uncommitted; the first release waits for a clean pushed revision.
 >>[2026-10-12 20:17] decide — Creator asked to prepare prereleases that can be tested in production. A prerelease is keyed by revision at pre/<rev12>/ with the release layout; spw.quest serves it from gitignored assets at /parser/pre/ and /parser/next.js, never through latest.js, and a ?parser= switch on the guide runs it for one visitor.
 >>[2026-10-12 20:35] decide — Creator found pre/<revision> awkward and settled the names: a release YYYY.MM.DD is cut once, a prerelease is YYYY.MM.DD-pre.N and a fix to a published day is YYYY.MM.DD-patch.N, numbered per day and kind with the same revision keeping its number. Offsets are gone; each folder holds parser.js, full and lite in min and debug forms, and a spw.parser-release/2 manifest.
 >>[2026-10-12 20:35] implement — Builder, tests (19 pass) and docs/runtime/md/parser-release.md moved to /2 as ~[release_names]; .[prerelease_builder](a6d69642) marked landed. The site agent carries the same names into spw.quest routes, ordering pre.N, the release, then patch.N.
 >>[2026-10-12 20:36] implement — Landed .[release_names](749899ee). Cut 2026.10.13-pre.1 from the clean tree at 749899ee: full.min.js 74362 B (18550 B gzipped), lite.min.js 2930 B; no dirty mark; parser.js parses ~door.
 >>[2026-10-12 20:42] verify — spw.quest carries 2026.10.13-pre.1 in gitignored assets with every sha256 matching; routes, next.js, latest.js (never a prerelease) and the ?parser= switch are rebuilt for the names, worker tests 39 pass and check:workers passes; uncommitted in the site tree until tried in production.
 >>[2026-10-12 20:52] implement — Site commits landed: 051a5a7d carries the names, prerelease routes, next.js and the ?parser= switch; 2026.10.13-pre.1 sits in gitignored assets and deploys from the working tree. 55fb8f75 was the first route shape, on offsets.
 >>[2026-10-13 22:04] implement — On feature/reader-bundle (664042aa): the release adds a reader variant, reader.min.js at 85 KB against 78 KB for the parser alone, with roles, outline, anchors, highlightHtml, parse, and parseExpression. The build points @spwashi/spw-seed at packages/spw-seed/src/reader.ts. test:parser-release passes 20 of 20, importing the reader bundle as a browser would. Additive: the manifest stays spw.parser-release/2.
 >>[2026-10-13 22:09] implement — The reader merged to main as 603f6b59, rebased from 664042aa; the next release cut carries reader.min.js.
 >>[2026-10-13 22:57] implement — On feature/browser-workbench (b082d500): a workbench build, 411 KB minified and 125 KB gzipped, carries seed's whole API, the runtime's root, and the reader; test:parser-release 21 of 21. The next cut carries reader and workbench.
}
